<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: TOP 5 TRAP ANALYSIS ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、模擬2 SSPA 五大Trap重災區（L19 檢討）</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">Trap一：T1 Large Numbers —「四捨五入」近似值Trap <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 取近似值時必須看清「取至哪一位」——萬位、千位、百位？<br/>
      ② 關鍵規則：看目標位的<strong>下一位</strong>數字決定「入」還是「捨」<br/>
      ③ Common Mistake：取至「萬位」卻看了千位就停，沒確認萬位本身的值<br/>
      ④ 另一錯誤：入位後忘記把後面所有位清零（例如 345,678 取至萬位 = 350,000，不是 35,000）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 T1-1：模擬2第5題相似題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">把 2,847,563 取近似值至「十萬位」。</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">2,800,000</div><div class="why">只看了萬位 4（捨），但十萬位是 8，要看百萬位的下一級</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">2,800,000</div><div class="why">十萬位 = 8，看萬位 = 4（&lt;5，捨）→ 2,800,000</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">Trap二：T2 Decimal — DecimalMultiplicationDecimal點位置Trap <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① DecimalMultiplication：先當整數乘，再數總Decimal位數點Decimal點<br/>
      ② <strong>最高頻錯誤</strong>：0.3 × 0.4 = 1.2（正確 = 0.12）——忘記Decimal乘Decimal會越乘越小<br/>
      ③ 第二錯誤：Decimal點位置放錯——應該從<strong>最右邊</strong>開始向左數<br/>
      ④ 驗證Mnemonic：「乘數 &lt; 1 → 積 &lt; 被乘數」（0.3 × 0.4 → 答案必 &lt; 0.3）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 T2-1：模擬2第2題相似題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算 0.25 × 0.4 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">0.25 × 0.4 = 1.00</div><div class="why">直接 25×4=100，Decimal點忘了從右邊開始數</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">0.25 × 0.4 = 0.100 = 0.1</div><div class="why">25×4=100，總Decimal位 2+1=3 → 0.100 → 最簡 0.1</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">Trap三：T5 Area — Trapezoid/多邊形Area單位混淆 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① TrapezoidArea = (上底+下底) × 高 ÷ 2 —— <strong>不是</strong> (上底+下底+高) × 2<br/>
      ② ParallelogramArea = 底 × 高（<strong>不是</strong> 底 × 斜邊）<br/>
      ③ TriangleArea = 底 × 高 ÷ 2 —— 必須<strong>除以 2</strong>！<br/>
      ④ 組合圖形：先分割成基本圖形，分別求Area，再加總
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 T5-1：模擬2TrapezoidArea題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">Trapezoid上底 8 cm，下底 12 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">(8+12+5) × 2 = 50 cm²</div><div class="why">混淆周長與Area公式——加了高又乘2</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">(8+12)×5÷2 = 50 cm²</div><div class="why">(上底+下底)×高÷2 = 20×5÷2 = 50 cm²</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">Trap四：T9 Fraction — 異分母加減「直加直減」 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 異分母Fraction<strong>不能</strong>直接加減——必須先通分<br/>
      ② 通分三步：找LCM → 分子同步擴大 → 分母不變分子相加<br/>
      ③ 答案必須約至<strong>最簡Fraction</strong>，假Fraction必須化<strong>帶Fraction</strong><br/>
      ④ 帶Fraction加減：推薦轉假Fraction法（最不易出錯）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 T9-1：模擬2Fraction題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span></div><div class="why">分子+分子，分母+分母——異分母絕不能直加！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">11</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span></div><div class="why">LCM(3,4)=12 → <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">11</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">Trap五：T3 逆向題 — 已知結果求原數 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 逆向題關鍵：從<strong>最終結果</strong>開始，<strong>倒推</strong>運算<br/>
      ② 倒推時加減互逆、乘除互逆：原來「加」的倒推變「減」<br/>
      ③ 最好用<strong>Equation</strong>輔助：設未知數 → 列式 → 解Equation<br/>
      ④ 驗證：把答案代回原題檢查是否合理
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 T3-1：模擬2逆向題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">小明有一些糖。吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 後，又買了 15 粒，現在有 45 粒。原來有多少粒？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">45 + 15 = 60，60 × <span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = 20</div><div class="why">正向亂算，沒有倒推——買了15才到45，應先減15</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">(45 − 15) ÷ (1 − <span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>) = 30 ÷ <span class="fi"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = 45</div><div class="why">倒推：買15前有30粒，這是吃了<span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>後剩下的<span class="fi"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 五大Trap總Mnemonic：「Large Numbers睇位、Decimal數點、Area背公式、Fraction先通分、逆向倒轉推」</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: SELF-DIAGNOSIS + WINTER PLAN ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">二、個人弱點自我診斷（Self-Assessment Checklist）</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 請誠實自評以下 10 項，勾選你經常犯錯的項目。這是你寒假特訓的「靶心」！</div>
<table class="chk">
<tr><th class="chk-box">✓</th><th>弱點描述</th><th class="chk-lvl">Trap類別</th><th class="chk-lvl">SSPA頻率</th></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q1.</b> Large Numbers取近似值時，取錯目標位（例如取至千位看成取至萬位）</td><td class="chk-lvl">T1 Large Numbers</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q2.</b> Large Numbers取近似值後忘記把後面位數清零</td><td class="chk-lvl">T1 Large Numbers</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q3.</b> DecimalMultiplicationDecimal點位置錯誤（尤其 0.3 × 0.4 類）</td><td class="chk-lvl">T2 Decimal</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q4.</b> DecimalDivision的商的Decimal點位置出錯</td><td class="chk-lvl">T2 Decimal</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">🟡 中</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q5.</b> TrapezoidArea忘記除以 2，或用了錯誤公式（例如加了高再乘）</td><td class="chk-lvl">T5 Area</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q6.</b> 組合圖形Area：忘記分割或重疊部分計算錯誤</td><td class="chk-lvl">T5 Area</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q7.</b> 異分母Fraction直接加減（分子+分子，分母+分母）</td><td class="chk-lvl">T9 Fraction</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q8.</b> Fraction答案忘記約簡，或假Fraction沒化成帶Fraction</td><td class="chk-lvl">T9 Fraction</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q9.</b> 逆向題倒推時運算方向弄反（加變減時忘了變）</td><td class="chk-lvl">T3 逆向</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="chk-box">☐</td><td class="chk-q"><b>Q10.</b> Word Problems漏寫答句／漏寫單位／列式混亂</td><td class="chk-lvl">T7 應用</td><td class="chk-lvl"><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">🟡 中</span></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">三、寒假 SSPA 每日 15 min特訓計劃（兩週 = 14 天）</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">計劃原則 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 備戰</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 每天只需 <strong>15 min</strong>——重點是<strong>持續</strong>而非長時間<br/>
      ② 每天聚焦 <strong>1 個Trap</strong>，輪流練習五大Trap（兩週可循環兩次）<br/>
      ③ 每次練習：3 min溫習規則 → 10 min做題 → 2 min對答案標錯<br/>
      ④ 週日休息（或補回週中未完成的練習）
    </div>
</div>
<table class="plan">
<tr><th class="day">日</th><th>Date</th><th>聚焦Trap</th><th>練習內容（15min）</th><th>✓</th></tr>
<tr><td class="day">1</td><td>Day 1</td><td>T1 Large Numbers</td><td>取近似值 5 題 + 讀數寫數 5 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">2</td><td>Day 2</td><td>T2 Decimal</td><td>DecimalMultiplication 5 題 + DecimalDivision 5 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">3</td><td>Day 3</td><td>T5 Area</td><td>TrapezoidArea 3 題 + TriangleArea 3 題 + 組合圖形 2 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">4</td><td>Day 4</td><td>T9 Fraction</td><td>異分母加減 5 題 + 帶Fraction加減 5 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">5</td><td>Day 5</td><td>T3 逆向</td><td>逆向題 5 題（用Equation輔助）+ Word Problems 3 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">6</td><td>Day 6</td><td>T1+T2 混合</td><td>Large Numbers+Decimal混合練習 10 題（計時 12 min）</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">7</td><td>Day 7</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align:center;color:var(--green);font-weight:700;">🌿 休息日（或補回 Day 1-6 未完成的Question）</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">8</td><td>Day 8</td><td>T5 Area</td><td>所有圖形Area混合 10 題（計時 12 min）</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">9</td><td>Day 9</td><td>T9 Fraction</td><td>Fraction四則混合 5 題 + Word Problems 5 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">10</td><td>Day 10</td><td>T3 逆向</td><td>逆向題 5 題 + Equation應用 5 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">11</td><td>Day 11</td><td>T2 Decimal</td><td>Decimal四則混合 10 題（含近似值）</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">12</td><td>Day 12</td><td>綜合</td><td>模擬卷精選 10 題（限時 15 min）</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">13</td><td>Day 13</td><td>個人最弱</td><td>針對 Day 1-12 標錯最多的Trap，再做 10 題</td><td>☐</td></tr>
<tr><td class="day">14</td><td>Day 14</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align:center;color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">📋 總結：統計兩週錯題，列出「仍需加強」清單</td><td>☐</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 關鍵規則：每次練習後必須「對答案 + 標錯題 + 搞懂錯因」。只做不檢 = 白做。</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: REVIEW QUESTIONS (1-20) ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、L19 Common Mistake針對性複習題（共 20 題 · 聚焦五大Trap）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">A 組 — T1 Large Numbers近似值（第 1-4 題）</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FEF2F2,#FFF8E7);border:2px solid var(--red);border-radius:6px;">
<strong style="color:#991B1B;">🎫 考試錦囊（SSPA 必讀）</strong>
<p style="font-size:11px;margin:4px 0;color:#1A1A1A;">
① 先做識做嘅Question，唔好卡死喺一條！<br/>
② 每題檢查單位（cm vs cm² vs cm³）！<br/>
③ 幾何題：圖中有標高就係高，冇標就用公式反求！<br/>
④ Word Problems：寫答句！唔寫扣步驟分！<br/>
⑤ 剩 5 min：檢查 MC 有冇填漏 + 單位有冇寫啱！
</p>
</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 SSPA衝刺·限時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">模擬真實SSPA考試！限時作答，每題計分。答對率達80%解鎖「SSPA戰士」勳章！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始模擬考 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R1</td><td>把 3,456,789 取近似值至「十萬位」。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R2</td><td>把 67,890,123 取近似值至「百萬位」。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R3</td><td>把 4,507,632 取至萬位的近似值。並寫出你看的是哪一位數字。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R4</td><td>以下哪個是 29,876,543 取至百萬位的正確近似值？A. 29,000,000 B. 30,000,000 C. 29,900,000 D. 20,000,000</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">B 組 — T2 Decimal計算（第 5-8 題）</div>
