<tr><td class="lf-qn">R6</td><td>計算 0.25 × 0.8 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R7</td><td>計算 0.15 × 0.4 = ？（寫出 15×4=60 後的正確Decimal點位置）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R8</td><td>計算 0.05 × 0.02 = ？（注意：Decimal點後有幾個零？）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">C 組 — T5 AreaTrap（第 9-12 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
