<tr><td class="lf-qn">R10</td><td>Triangle底 8 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？（小心：你有除以 2 嗎？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R11</td><td>Parallelogram底 9 cm，高 6 cm，斜邊 7 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R12</td><td>一個組合圖形由一個Trapezoid和一個Parallelogram組成。Trapezoid：(4+8)×3÷2，Parallelogram：5×3。總Area = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">D 組 — T9 Fraction運算（第 13-16 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R13</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？（先通分！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R14</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> − <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？（記得約簡！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R15</td><td>1<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + 2<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？（提示：轉假Fraction法）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R16</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？（三個Fraction通分）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">E 組 — T3 逆向題（第 17-20 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R17</td><td>某數先加 15，再乘 3，結果是 90。求該數。（用倒推法）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R18</td><td>小明把儲蓄的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 用了後，再存入 $30，現在有 $90。原來有多少元？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R19</td><td>一個數，先減去 28，再除以 4，然後加 10，結果是 25。求原數。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">R20</td><td>桶裡有一些水。倒出 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 後，再加 3 升，現在有 10 升。原來有多少升？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
