<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Decimal】</span>計算 0.35 × 0.6 = ？（先整數乘，再數Decimal位）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Area】</span>Parallelogram底 12 cm，高 5 cm。Area = ？（不要用斜邊！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">32</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Fraction】</span><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？（LCM(5,3)=？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">33</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Equation】</span>某數的 3 倍加 12 等於 48。求某數。（倒推：48−12=36，36÷3=？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">34</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Decimal】</span>計算 0.45 ÷ 0.5 = ？（提示：除以 0.5 = 乘以 2）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">35</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Area】</span>Trapezoid上底 3 cm，下底 9 cm，高 8 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">36</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【Fraction】</span>2<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（先轉假Fraction）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
